{"author":"lars@oddbit.com","body":"When rebooting both routers, backhaul-2 experiences a 4-minute period during which:\n\n- Network access over the transit link works fine, but\n- Network access over eth1 (house network) does not work\n- Even thought it has associated with the AP and has acquired an address\n\nThis seems to be triggered when rebooting both routers simultaneously. When\nrebooting just backhaul-2, it seems to come back up quickly."}